  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "制作:ぷらすえ<br />\nシナリオ:おおじさ<br />\n<a href=\"https://ci-en.dlsite.com/creator/12788\" target=\"_blank\">https://ci-en.dlsite.com/creator/12788</a><br />\n<br />\nイラスト:秘密にしといてあげる<br />\n<a href=\"https://x.com/haokisatsu79198\" target=\"_blank\">https://x.com/haokisatsu79198</a><br />\n<br />\n宣伝画像制作:Krachware<br />\n<a href=\"https://ci-en.net/creator/2397\" target=\"_blank\">https://ci-en.net/creator/2397</a><br />\n<br />\n【声優】<br />\n・月詠すい(二本柳ユイカ役)<br />\n<a href=\"https://tukinaga0v0sui8.wixsite.com/suivoice\" target=\"_blank\">https://tukinaga0v0sui8.wixsite.com/suivoice</a><br />\n<br />\n・鳴坂みあ(片平ふうか役)<br />\n<a href=\"https://x.com/narusaka_mia\" target=\"_blank\">https://x.com/narusaka_mia</a><br />\n<br />\n・彩夢ひな(後田あかね役)<br />\n<a href=\"https://hinata05saku.wixsite.com/-site\" target=\"_blank\">https://hinata05saku.wixsite.com/-site</a><br />\n<br />\n・星野天(長岡ゆず役)<br />\n<a href=\"https://hoshinora1212.wixsite.com/hoshinosora\" target=\"_blank\">https://hoshinora1212.wixsite.com/hoshinosora</a><br />\n<br />\n・飴屋ぺろり(小川かえで役)<br />\n<a href=\"https://ameyaperoriinc.wixsite.com/voicepr\" target=\"_blank\">https://ameyaperoriinc.wixsite.com/voicepr</a><br />\n<br />\n・結音しなん(森山しおり役)<br />\n<a href=\"https://yozoraspica227.wixsite.com/spicanata/yune-home\" target=\"_blank\">https://yozoraspica227.wixsite.com/spicanata/yune-home</a><br />\n<br />\n・暁鞠子(二俣なな役)<br />\n<a href=\"https://sayundine.wixsite.com/aktkmrk\" target=\"_blank\">https://sayundine.wixsite.com/aktkmrk</a><br />\n<br />\n・眠音りま(高丸あい役)<br />\n<a href=\"https://nemurima221.wixsite.com/nemurima\" target=\"_blank\">https://nemurima221.wixsite.com/nemurima</a>"
    }
   ]
